{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32863","headline":"寄辛明府 · 李频","name":"寄辛明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处无苛政，东南有子男。\n细将朝客说，须是邑人谙。\n别业空经稔，归田独未甘。\n目凝烟积树，心贮月明潭。\n晓鼓愁方乱，春山睡正酣。\n不任啼鸟思，乡社欲桑蚕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}